<title>HONG KONG: Indosuez W.I. Carr sets warrants on H-share basket.</title>
<headline>Indosuez W.I. Carr sets warrants on H-share basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indosuez W.I. Carr (Derivatives) Ltd said on Friday it intended to launch 750 million American-style call warrants on a basket of seven locally-listed Chinese enterprises H-shares.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> Tsingtao Brewery Co Ltd		     0.05 shares</p>
<p> Qingling Motors Ltd			   0.08 shares</p>
<p> Zhenhai Refining &amp; Chemical Co Ltd	0.08 shares</p>
<p> Shanghai Petrochemical Co Ltd	     0.17 shares</p>
<p> Maanshan Iron and Steel Co Ltd	    0.26 shares</p>
<p> Jilin Chemical Industrial Co Ltd	  0.20 shares</p>
<p> Guangshen Railway Co Ltd		    0.10 shares</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$2.3188	PREMIUM	 30.88 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.0716	GEARING	 3.25x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  03.APR.98	EXER LOT	10,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$2.3188</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
